// IntroString :
"P718345325" "You think you know all about Arachnos, huh? Sure you do. Big, fancy posters, lotsa pomp 'n' circumstance. Well, let me tell you, {VillainName}: you don't know jack. That's ok, though. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>You're about to find out.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P1108018925" "Find out about Arachnos"
// SendOffString :
"P3083252388" "I like to keep tabs on my neighbors, so I need you to plant these little bugs on the flyers inside Fort Darwin. Easy peasy. It'll give you a chance to see what Arachnos is like in combat. Heck, you might even impress 'em! Arachnos is always looking for the latest good material to come out of the Zig. They use this whole island as a proving ground for their fresh meat.<br><br>Here's an access code to get into Fort Darwin. Wait until the coast is clear, then plant the bugs on the Arachnos flyers."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2301657272" "Plant bugs on flyers"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P4054354378" "Still got a few bugs, ain'tcha? Got to plant 'em all."

