"P2212711838" "Good job, {VillainName}. Arachnos has been a thorn in my side ever since I set foot on Darwin's Landing. They think they own everything and everyone here. Most of the time, they're right. Just don't you let them be your masters, ok, {VillainName}? You've got what I'd call a bright future ahead of you."
