// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - MuCodex 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P715307754" "The Mu Codex"
// DetailString :
"P3920000468" "Mako hired Burke to steal this book from Ghost Widow's faction. Burke is hoping to keep it for himself, though, which is a dangerous proposition."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3024014845" "Glad to see you, {VillainName}. We've got a job.  <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Seems someone's hired us to steal some old book from Ghost Widow's faction.</A> The book is called the Mu Codex. Who's hired us, you ask? Why, Mako's faction! That's right; those Arachnos factions are always at each other's throats. You'd best remember that if you ever decide to get involved with their lot. Trust no one."
// AcceptString :
"P4274154903" "Steal book from Ghost Widow"
// SendOffString :
"P4268928737" "Oh, there's one more thing I didn't tell you. I'm planning to keep this book for myself. So wipe out everyone in the Arachnos lab, won't you, {VillainName}. It's the only way we can get away clean."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3964554387" "Defeat all operatives in base"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P382977899" "You've got an book to steal, ain'tcha?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P85615720" "Burke's weaving a dangerous web by trying to play two Arachnos factions against each other. Better make sure you don't get caught in the crossfire."

