// Dialog :
"P1431279651" "Excellent job, {VillainName}. These files will serve me well. They should let me eavesdrop on secret Arachnos conversations--at least, until these ciphers are rotated out of use. It's important to keep an eye on Arachnos. They're always testing everybody here on Mercy, myself included. Trying to figure out who's strong enough to survive, and who's weak enough to crush under their boot heels. When someone's watching you, {VillainName}, it's a good idea to watch them right back."
// RandomFameString :
"P1312359493" "I hear {VillainName} took down a Longbow cryptographer, Agent Kurst!"
